<title>POLAND: Agros to list 2.4 mln shares June 26.</title>
<headline>Agros to list 2.4 mln shares June 26.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Agros SA's 2,425,000-million-share issue conducted earlier this year will enter the Warsaw Stock Exchange on June 26, bourse deputy head Wlodzimierz Magiera told reporters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The firm currently has 4,450,000 shares in bourse trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
